{'symbol': 'A', 'date': '2019-09-30 22:30:00', 'title': 'MOLECULAR ASSEMBLIES, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RECEIVED $12.2 MILLION IN FUNDING FROM ISELECT FUND MANAGEMENT, LLC, ARGONAUTIC VENTURES, ALEXANDRIA VENTURE INVESTMENTS, LLC, KESHIF VENTURES, LLC, AGILENT TECHNOLOGIES, INC.', 'text': 'ON OCTOBER 1, 2019, MOLECULAR ASSEMBLIES, INC. CLOSED THE TRANSACTION. THE COMPANY RECEIVED $12,200,000 LED BY NEW INVESTOR, ISELECT FUND, LLC, A FUND MANAGED BY ISELECT FUND MANAGEMENT, LLC AND ARGONAUTIC VENTURES ON OCTOBER 1, 2019. THE TRANSACTION ALSO INCLUDED PARTICIPATION FROM RETURNING INVESTORS, AGILENT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE:A), ALEXANDRIA VENTURE INVESTMENTS, LLC, AND KESHIF VENTURES, LLC. THE COMPANY RAISED $3,718,809 PURSUANT TO EXEMPTION PROVIDED UNDER REGULATION D. THE TRANSACTION INCLUDED PARTICIPATION FROM EIGHT INVESTORS PURSUANT TO EXEMPTION PROVIDED UNDER REGULATION D.'}